&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree and a minimum of 5-7 years of accounting or finance experience. Big 4 public accounting preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
